asures concealed in mysterious tubes, abandoned spacecraft, or floating directly in space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful: enemy ships are on patrol and won’t hesitate to fire at you. Survive their attacks while collecting essential resources such as missile ammunition, energy for your laser shots, and fuel reserves. Every decision matters as you navigate and optimize your route.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ounba can be played <strong>solo</strong> or <strong>in two-player split-screen</strong>, using two controllers or a controller and keyboard. Two global leaderboards are available: one for solo players and one for duo teams, so you can compare your achievements with the community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features <strong>five levels</strong>, each with unique environments and increasing difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can save your progress <strong>at any moment</strong>, whether playing alone or with a friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the <strong>community hub</strong>, take part in discussions, and share your most exciting screenshots. The Ounba adventure awaits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885500/extras/c5395ffc372db98cc4b5548a4191ac48.avif?t=1788280501\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Dive into space in Ounba: collect coins, diamonds, ammo, and energy while avoiding enemy fire. Play solo or with a friend in split-screen, save anytime, and challenge the community across five unique levels with increasing excitement and challenges.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Bulgarian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Danish, Spanish - Latin America, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Japanese, Norwegian, Dutch, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Swedish, Czech, Thai, Turkish, 